/*!
\page page_strichmchit StRichMCHit

\brief \ref page_strichmchit "StRichMCHit" — Monte Carlo RICH hit pairing a reconstructed hit with generator-level truth.

\section strichmchit_overview Overview
StRichMCHit extends \ref page_strichhit "StRichHit" with a
\ref page_strichmcinfo "StRichMCInfo" truth record stored by value. It allows
direct comparison between reconstructed hit quantities and the known simulation
input, enabling detector performance studies and efficiency measurements.

\section strichmchit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StMeasuredPoint
        └── StHit
            └── StRichHit
                └── StRichMCHit
\endcode

\section strichmchit_members Data Members
| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| StRichMCInfo | mInfo | MC truth record (stored by value) |

All data members of \ref page_strichhit "StRichHit" are also available.

\section strichmchit_methods Key Methods
| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| const StRichMCInfo& getMCInfo() const | Returns the MC truth record |
| void setMCInfo(const StRichMCInfo&) | Sets the MC truth record |

\section strichmchit_example Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StRichCollection* rich = event->richCollection();
StSPtrVecRichHit& hits = rich->getRichHits();
for (const auto& hit : hits) {
    StRichMCHit* mcHit = dynamic_cast<StRichMCHit*>(hit);
    if (!mcHit) continue;
    const StRichMCInfo& info = mcHit->getMCInfo();
    int geantPid = info.gid();
    int process  = info.process();
}
\endcode

\section strichmchit_related Related Classes
\ref page_strichhit "StRichHit" — base reconstructed hit. \n
\ref page_strichmcinfo "StRichMCInfo" — MC truth record embedded in this hit. \n
\ref page_strichmcpixel "StRichMCPixel" — MC pixel analogue at the raw-data level.
*/
